00:47:57,659 --> 00:47:58,419
There's nothing else.

804
00:47:59,199 --> 00:48:06,421
And in order to have that nice behavior,

805
00:48:06,901 --> 00:48:11,782
we have to use a specific syntax that the shell understands.

806
00:48:14,391 --> 00:48:18,573
when you're trying to find commands,

807
00:48:18,633 --> 00:48:21,574
you might try to use the history.

